        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "H. Should either party suggest an impasse, the procedures as provided for in Section 6-510 of the Annotated Code, Education relating to impasse will be followed. In the event that the parties are unable to agree upon a third party, as required, the parties agree to submit their impasse to the American Arbitration Association for assistance in the selection of a third party.",
            "block_bbox": [
